# ZMPGCD - greatest common factor of two polynomials (Euclid's algorithm).
# Input : ʟMPP, ʟMPQ (ʟMPQ not zero)
# Output: ʟMPP = the GCF, whole numbers, positive leading coefficient
# Uses  : I,Y,Z, ʟMPQ ʟMPS ʟMPT
Repeat dim(ʟMPQ)=1 and ʟMPQ(1)=0
  ʟMPQ/ʟMPQ(1)→ʟMPQ
  prgmZMPDIV
  ʟMPP→ʟMPT
  ʟMPQ→ʟMPP
  ʟMPT→ʟMPQ
End
prgmZMPINT
